    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the action with Master of the Arena, an electrifying arena brawler for up to 8 players! Battle it out solo or with friends in intense, skill-based rounds that challenge your reflexes and strategy. Whether you aim to be the last one standing or prefer to team up against relentless monsters, every match is an adrenaline-filled experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Abilities</strong>: Tailor your skill set to fit your playstyle, experimenting with different combos to outsmart opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo and Co-op Modes</strong>: Test your mettle in free-for-all battles or form alliances to take down powerful foes in cooperative challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong>: Bring the chaos to your living room with support for up to 8 players in local multiplayer action.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, skill-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep customization for endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting solo and multiplayer modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging monsters and dynamic rounds</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the action with Master of the Arena, an electrifying arena brawler for up to 8 players! Battle it out solo or with friends in intense, skill-based rounds that challenge your reflexes and strategy. Whether you aim to be the last one standing or prefer to team up against relentless monsters, every match is an adrenaline-filled experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Abilities</strong>: Tailor your skill set to fit your playstyle, experimenting with different combos to outsmart opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo and Co-op Modes</strong>: Test your mettle in free-for-all battles or form alliances to take down powerful foes in cooperative challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong>: Bring the chaos to your living room with support for up to 8 players in local multiplayer action.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, skill-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep customization for endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting solo and multiplayer modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging monsters and dynamic rounds</p></li></ul>",
